#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:5
#: c54932e18b8c4ed087b8c8ba9cf17150
msgid "ArduSimple"
msgstr "ArduSimple"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:7
#: 22f92da8a0d04a569038f04991ab5d8f
msgid ""
"ArduSimple provides a number of UBlox F9P based GNSS receivers that support "
"RTK and GPS-for-Yaw. Using RTK allows ArduPilot with centimeter level "
"accuracy which is much more accurate than a normal GPS."
msgstr ""
"ArduSimple 提供多种基于 UBlox F9P 的 GNSS 接收器，支持 RTK 和 GPS 偏航。使用 RTK 允许 ArduPilot "
"实现厘米级精度，远比普通 GPS 准确。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:9
#: 27b4b1ee7c7840daafbff020a0e3d2e6
msgid ""
"The simpleRTK2B system has two receiver modules which plug together and the "
"simpleRTK3b is a single integrated unit."
msgstr "simpleRTK2B 系统有两个插合在一起的接收器模块，simpleRTK3b 是单一集成单元。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:12
#: 1aee91dd7402479292a852972a04acff
msgid "Where to Buy"
msgstr "购买渠道"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:14
#: fb747709852f46e7af679550fd885360
msgid "`ArduSimple website <https://www.ardusimple.com/>`_"
msgstr "`ArduSimple 网站 <https://www.ardusimple.com/>`_"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:18
#: 35f2e2a1bcb6468b8e80dad4f39080c2
msgid "Pin Map"
msgstr "引脚映射"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:20
#: 7b124cbc480e44e4a9c3faca81c0d5d5
msgid "The system is connected to the autopilot via one of its UARTs."
msgstr "系统通过一个 UART 连接到飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:22
#: bd191df55d804bceae877287696da3f6
msgid "The JST-GH connector is following the Pixhawk standard:"
msgstr "JST-GH 连接器遵循 Pixhawk 标准："

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:24
#: 56eb9389e436483ba5fbd103993b007b
msgid "1: 5V_IN"
msgstr "1：5V_IN"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:25
#: af719da2d30f4ab0a41ed9211beb5c6d
msgid "2: ZED-F9P UART1 RX (3.3V level)"
msgstr "2：ZED-F9P UART1 RX（3.3V 电平）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:26
#: b8510b920cf74652aef38e6c86cc550d
msgid "3: ZED-F9P UART1 TX (3.3V level)"
msgstr "3：ZED-F9P UART1 TX（3.3V 电平）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:27
#: 658d7d6204264cbe86ca8990076f5ec7
msgid "4,5: Not connected"
msgstr "4、5：未连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:28
#: c8f95a16c45b4cad831ac27a38c87637
msgid "6: GND"
msgstr "6：GND"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:30
#: 963a748e3702436ead19f905f87b4bed
msgid ""
"Please note that the board only includes GPS and doesn’t include compass."
msgstr "请注意，该板仅包含 GPS，不包含罗盘。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:37
#: 85eb974521d144169c7cb7b4254db2e7
msgid "Wiring and Connections"
msgstr "接线与连接"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:39
#: ccc5758e5b5d46d7b8124b512b4ef13a
msgid ""
"All ArduSimple GNSS models come with a JST GH 6-pin connector/cable that is "
"compatible with the Pixhawk family and many other autopilots."
msgstr "所有 ArduSimple GNSS 型号均配有与 Pixhawk 系列和许多其他飞控兼容的 JST GH 6 针连接器/电缆。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:41
#: 5eb2a8eed1124c4c8cb5b491c94a112d
msgid ""
"The cables/connectors may be modified to connect to other autopilot boards, "
"using the Pin Map information provided above."
msgstr "可以使用上方提供的引脚映射信息修改电缆/连接器以连接到其他飞控板。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:44
#: 9bcc74cfcbc94bff863a3ba9f4e44d8c
msgid "Configuration"
msgstr "配置"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:46
#: 90bec98fa7484e7f827b22c01c0fa89a
msgid ""
"For normal GPS only operation, ArduPilot's GPS parameter defaults will work "
"for any serial port configured for ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 5."
msgstr ""
"对于普通 GPS 操作，ArduPilot 的 GPS 参数默认值适用于任何配置了 ``SERIALx_PROTOCOL`` = 5 的串口。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:48
#: 2f89e8e2c72f4efcac330f4d76dea3ae
msgid ""
"For GPS-for-Yaw, please refer to :ref:`GPS-for-Yaw <common-gps-for-yaw>`, "
"but ArduSimple provides detailed setup guides for each system on their "
"website:"
msgstr ""
"对于 GPS 偏航，请参见 :ref:`GPS-for-Yaw <common-gps-for-yaw>`，但 ArduSimple "
"在其网站上为每个系统提供了详细的设置指南："

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:50
#: 3ccc44cf2d39432281be8ab0639aacc5
msgid ""
"`simpleRTK2B instructions <https://www.ardusimple.com/ardupilot-"
"simplertk2bheading-configuration/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`simpleRTK2B 说明 <https://www.ardusimple.com/ardupilot-simplertk2bheading-"
"configuration/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:52
#: d843c4733b7a4b6e942bd14bdecf2435
msgid ""
"`simpleRTK3B instructions <https://www.ardusimple.com/ardupilot-"
"simplertk3b-heading-configuration/>`__"
msgstr ""
"`simpleRTK3B 说明 <https://www.ardusimple.com/ardupilot-simplertk3b-heading-"
"configuration/>`__"

#: ../../source/docs/common-gps-ardusimple.rst:54
#: dfc9e5bef7604324a6019c288d343ecb
msgid ""
"ArduPilot does not currently configure UBlox F9P GPS constellations. User "
"must assure that the GPS is properly configured for their region and "
"application. See :ref:`common-gps-ublox-firmware-update`"
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 目前不配置 UBlox F9P GPS 星座。用户必须确保 GPS 已为其地区和应用正确配置。见 :ref:`common-gps-"
"ublox-firmware-update`"
